 2614:    // Instead, we nudge the intersection point to the barycenter of the current element, and nextElement becomes
 2615:    // curElement.
 2616: 
 2617:    // Then it finds the tangential velocity at the element side (the side where the intersection was found),
 2618:    // And uses this velocity instead to continue the tracking.
